# Raw landed snapshots of the Fleetyards model list. Same separation the repo
# already uses for data-layer/external-sources/: the raw pull is gitignored,
# the provenance record is not. ../MANIFEST.json carries the source endpoint,
# the fetch timestamp, the record count and the sha256 of the snapshot, so the
# record survives even though the 5.9 MB payload is not committed.
*.json
!.gitignore
